Z||000003||88 Database Nut||04-26-2000||08:44 AM||||Thanks Radar, and You Too TOM.  Sorry if I've been neglecting to respond, but I try to squeeze this in on my lunch break and after work and with a new 9 hour work day I haven't been staying late lately to catch up on email!  I'll send you both an update today,<BR>we're at 1051 cars.<P>Thanks guys for your help and patience!||||reg||1
