Z||000007||88 Database Nut||05-02-2000||01:55 PM||||Just an update, but we passed 4% of the '88s in the Database this last weekend at the swap meet at the Fiero Factory.  That might not sound like a big deal, but it represents about 800 people sending in information on their '88 Fieros, as well as 270 more from other sources.<P>I'm sure everyone who attended agrees that Ed and Rosy put on a terrific event, and next year promises to be even better.  This thing does put a big load on the Fiero Factory, and  I want to add my voice to the crowd's when I thank them for hosting the events, and for all the background work in getting things set up.  I understand the Alabama Fiero guys helped out and they also deserve credit for making this event so nice for the rest of us.<P>Thanks to All, Hope to see y'all again next year.||||reg||1
